@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #0B5CAD
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #0B5CAD
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam participantBorderColor #0B5CAD
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam actorBorderColor #0B5CAD
skinparam actorBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam databaseBorderColor #0B5CAD
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #F2F8FF
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
skinparam noteBorderColor #D4A72C
footer Open Innovation Platform | Generated at 20260422-164252

title Open Innovation Platform - 方案提交流转图

autonumber
actor "合作伙伴" as Partner
actor "评审员 / 管理员" as Reviewer
participant "提交方案页\n/dashboard/proposals/new" as ProposalPage
participant "方案创建 API\n/api/proposals" as ProposalAPI
participant "状态更新 API\n/api/proposals/[id]/status" as StatusAPI
participant "附件下载 API\n/api/attachments/[id]" as AttachmentAPI
participant "认证与会话\ninnovation-session" as Session
participant "Payload Local API" as Payload
participant "提案通知 Hook\nsendProposalNotification" as CreateHook
participant "状态通知 Hook\nonProposalStatusChange" as StatusHook
participant "邮件服务" as EmailSvc
participant "PostgreSQL" as Postgres
participant "media/ 文件目录" as MediaFS

== 提交阶段 ==
Partner -> ProposalPage : 填写方案 / 关联需求 / 选择多附件
ProposalPage -> ProposalAPI : POST FormData
ProposalAPI -> Session : getRequestUser()
ProposalAPI -> Payload : create proposal
Payload -> Postgres : 写入 proposals
loop 每个附件
  ProposalAPI -> Payload : create media(document)
  Payload -> MediaFS : 落盘文件
  Payload -> Postgres : 写入 media
end
ProposalAPI -> Payload : update proposal.attachments
Payload -> CreateHook : afterChange
CreateHook -> EmailSvc : sendProposalCreatedNotification()
EmailSvc --> Reviewer : 邮件通知评审待处理
ProposalAPI --> ProposalPage : 返回 proposal id / success

== 评审阶段 ==
Reviewer -> StatusAPI : 更新状态 + 评审意见
StatusAPI -> Session : 校验 reviewer/admin
StatusAPI -> Payload : update proposal.status / reviewNotes / reviewedBy
Payload -> Postgres : 更新 proposals
Payload -> StatusHook : afterChange
StatusHook -> EmailSvc : sendProposalStatusNotification()
EmailSvc --> Partner : 状态更新邮件
StatusAPI --> Reviewer : 保存成功

== 下载附件阶段 ==
Partner -> AttachmentAPI : GET /api/attachments/[id]
AttachmentAPI -> Session : 识别登录用户
AttachmentAPI -> Payload : find media / proposal
AttachmentAPI -> MediaFS : 读取附件文件
AttachmentAPI --> Partner : Content-Disposition: attachment

note right of AttachmentAPI
附件下载权限：
- admin
- reviewer
- 上传者
- 方案所有者
其他账号不可下载。
end note

@enduml
